      "title": "Work, inspire, lead",
      "description": "Search Page Home Benefits Why NAU? Contact FAQs My Profile Applicant Login Kiosk mode Work, inspire, lead at NAU Skip to jobs search results Category Search categories 5 filter options found Category Administration (1 items) 1 Facilities & Maintenance (1 items) 1 Faculty (2 items) 2 Post Doctoral Scholar (1 items) 1 Research (2 items) 2 Department Search departments 6 filter options found Department Col Environment, For & Nat Sci (2 items) 2 Facility Srv: Custodial Shop (1 items) 1 Mechanical Engineering (1 items) 1 NAU Career Development (1 items) 1 Sanghi College of Engineering (1 items) 1 Schl of Earth & Sustainability (1 items) 1 Employment Type Search employment types 3 filter options found Employment Type Faculty (2 items) 2 Post Doctoral Scholar (1 items) 1 University Staff (4 items) 4 City Search cities 2 filter options found City Flagstaff (6 items) 6 Fully Remote (1 items) 1 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Mechanical Engineering Part-Time Instructor Flagstaff, Arizona, United States Sanghi College of Engineering Faculty Faculty The Mechanical Engineering Department from Steve Sanghi College of Engineering (SCE) at Northern Arizona University invites applications for a part time (non-tenure track) position at the rank of Instructor. The successful candidate will have a strong mechanical engineering background and prior university teaching experience. Read more Research Technician Fully Remote, Arizona, United States Col Environment, For & Nat Sci Research University Staff The School of Forestry is seeking two field-based hydrologic technicians to support a long-term paired watershed experiment and other research in northern California. The technicians will collect water samples, maintain and repair hydrologic instruments, and plan, collect, and review data used to address questions related to forest hydrology, forest harvest, fuel reduction efforts, and meadow restoration. Read more Part-Time Temp Custodian - Housing (6am till 10am –Monday through Friday and potentially weekends) Flagstaff, Arizona, United States Facility Srv: Custodial Shop Facilities & Maintenance University Staff The Northern Arizona University Facility Services Custodial Department is currently hiring Part-Time Temp Custodians in Housing. The Custodial Department’s goal is to provide a clean, attractive and healthy learning environment. Read more Experiential Learning Coordinator Part-Time Temporary Flagstaff, Arizona, United States NAU Career Development Administration University Staff We are looking for an individual to assist with the day-to-day operations of the Job Shadow Program which aims to strengthen students’ career preparedness through short-term experiential learning. The Experiential Learning Coordinator will assist with all aspects of the Job Shadow Program, including meeting one-on-one with students to help them prepare for job shadows, communicating with students before and after job shadows, communicating with employers, tracking data, and marketing the program. The ideal candidate will have foundational career development knowledge, strong communication skills, and demonstrate a commitment to supporting students in their pursuit of career readiness. This position provides direct service to students requiring in-person work at the Flagstaff Mountain Campus between the hours of 8am-5pm M-F. Read more Postdoctoral Scholar Flagstaff, Arizona, United States Schl of Earth & Sustainability Post Doctoral Scholar Post Doctoral Scholar NAU's School of Earth & Sustainability seeks a Postdoctoral Scholar to join NSF-funded research projects exploring amino acid biogeochemistry. Read more Research Technician Flagstaff, Arizona, United States Col Environment, For & Nat Sci Research University Staff This position will work on a cooperative project between NAU and the NPS regarding water sources and quality in Grand Canyon National Park. Work will be done in conjunction with NPS hydrologists and geologists and with substantial office time at NPS facilities in Flagstaff, AZ and frequent field trips into the park. Read more Assistant Teaching Professor, Mechanical Engineering Flagstaff, Arizona, United States Mechanical Engineering Faculty Faculty The Mechanical Engineering Department from Steve Sanghi College of Engineering (SCE) at Northern Arizona University invites applications for a part time (non-tenure track) position at the rank of Instructor. The successful candidate will have a strong mechanical engineering background and prior university teaching experience. Read more Displaying all 7 entries Northern Arizona University is a committed Equal Opportunity Employer, including disabled/veterans. NAU is responsive to the needs of dual career couples. NAU is an Employer of National Service. AmeriCorps, Peace Corps, and other National Service alumni are encouraged to apply. © 2026 Arizona Board of Regents Candidate Details We use cookies. Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalize, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential only Accept all"
